  "sn2.16:1.1": "ṭhito kho Sudatto devaputto Bhagavato santike imaṃ gātham abhāsi || || ",
  "sn2.16:2.1": "Sattiyā viya omaṭṭho || ",
  "sn2.16:2.2": "ḍayhamāno va matthake || ",
  "sn2.16:2.3": "kāmarāgappahānāya || ",
  "sn2.16:2.4": "sato bhikkhu paribbaje ti || || 2. ",
  "sn2.16:3.1": "Sattiyā viya omaṭṭho || ",
  "sn2.16:3.2": "ḍayhamāno va matthake || ",
  "sn2.16:3.3": "sakkāya diṭṭhippahānāya || ",
  "sn2.16:3.4": "sato bhikkhu paribbaje ti || || 1. Ekam antaṃ "
